EXPO_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_your_publishable_key
EXPO_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_PROJECT_TOKEN=phc_your_project_token
EXPO_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com

# Prescription photo hosting. A wa.me link carries text only, so photos are
# uploaded first and the message carries their links. Get a free key at
# https://api.imgbb.com/ — uploads expire; LINK_LIFETIME_DAYS in lib/imgbb.ts
# sets how soon, and explains why the window is finite at all.
# Without it, the prescription screen says so instead of failing silently.
EXPO_PUBLIC_IMGBB_API_KEY=your_imgbb_api_key

# Maps need no key at all, and there is nothing to add here for them.
#
# The map shown in the app is Google's own `output=embed` view, which frames
# without an API key, and the link the rider taps is a plain maps.google.com
# URL carrying the coordinates. Both are free and unmetered. See mapsEmbedUrl
# and mapsLink in lib/location.ts.
#
# Naming a point is OpenStreetMap — the device's geocoder on a phone, Nominatim
# in the browser, and the nearest named landmark when neither can do better.
# Also keyless. Across much of Indore that lands on "Near Gehm Clinic" rather
# than a street name, which is on purpose: the text is a sanity check for the
# customer, and the rider navigates by the coordinates in the message.

# Where addresses and order history live, so they follow the customer between
# devices instead of dying with the phone. Create a project at supabase.com —
# the free plan needs no card — then run supabase/schema.sql in its SQL editor
# and register Clerk as a third-party auth provider.
#
# The publishable key is public by design: it ships in the bundle, and the row
# level security policies in the schema are what actually protect the data.
# Never put the service_role key here or anywhere in the app.
#
# Without both values the app stores addresses and history on the device only,
# exactly as it did before — degraded, not broken.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_your_key
